Package: microsoft-teams-pwa-local
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Teams Desktop Contributors <teams-desktop@example.invalid>
Depends: python3, libnss3, libgtk-3-0t64, libgbm1, libasound2t64, libx11-6, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxrandr2, libxfixes3, libdrm2, libatk1.0-0t64, libatk-bridge2.0-0t64, libcups2t64
Description: Microsoft Teams desktop wrapper with a background tray
 Dedicated sandboxed Electron @ELECTRON@ window for Microsoft Teams.
 Closing the window hides it; Quit Teams in the tray exits the app.
